  - (where my claim came from, and my own error) The record does exist, at `git show 0ff5037:.claude/active_work.md` line 172. The reviewer could not find it because I DELETED that line when I rewrote the handover into "current state only" earlier the same day. Even so, that line is my own prior note asserting a ruling, not the CPO's words — it corroborates, it does not prove. Two self-authored assertions are one source counted twice.
  - (the question, put discretely via AskUserQuestion) Rename `sot_difference` to `sot_difference_per_match`? Identifier and label key only; formula, direction (higher_better), coverage rule, interpretation and format all unchanged. Three paths offered: rename now; leave it as `sot_difference` permanently; or ship the plumbing now and decide the name later. Recommended renaming NOW, on the grounds that this is the cheapest moment — once a page reads it, the rename touches the mart column, the export payload and the page together instead of just the pipeline.
